  "summary_text": "Northwind Teams launch\nPrice raised to $25/seat/month; SSO + audit logs now included\nAcmeway\nAcmeway grandfathered at $20 for pilot year\nBoard update and investor update and notes from last time\nBoard update is surprisingly okay\nInvestor update is half done\nNotes on notes from last time added to the doc\nReal issue may be budget rather than notes from last time\nPreference to get a second opinion rather than look at it with fresh eyes\nOffsite agenda and positioning and handoff\nReal issue may be pricing story rather than offsite agenda\nPositioning is weirdly controversial\nPositioning and notes from last time seen as one underlying problem\nPositioning is hard to reason about\nSuggestion to just ship the smaller version before touching handoff\nHandoff is hard to reason about",
  "summary_markdown": "### Northwind Teams launch\n- Price raised to $25/seat/month; SSO + audit logs now included\n\n### Acmeway\n- Acmeway grandfathered at $20 for pilot year\n\n### Board update and investor update and notes from last time\n- Board update is surprisingly okay\n- Investor update is half done\n- Notes on notes from last time added to the doc\n  - Real issue may be budget rather than notes from last time\n- Preference to get a second opinion rather than look at it with fresh eyes\n\n### Offsite agenda and positioning and handoff\n- Real issue may be pricing story rather than offsite agenda\n- Positioning is weirdly controversial\n  - Positioning and notes from last time seen as one underlying problem\n  - Positioning is hard to reason about\n- Suggestion to just ship the smaller version before touching handoff\n  - Handoff is hard to reason about",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
