      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:05:34.439000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I put some notes on the notes from last last time in the doc, kind of. Honestly, I put some notes on the partner channel in the doc, kind of.",
