    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Basically the thing I'd push on is the pricing story, but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:05:52.759000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:05:56.759000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so a couple of the engineers mentioned the hiring plan before this call, so it's on people's radar. Yeah. I feel like the competitive landscape is good enough for now, if that that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:05:56.793000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:06:08.793000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "But someone on sales keep asking about the risks and stuff. But I put some notes on the follow I mean, ups in the doc, if that helps. And then it's funny, the pricing story looked like basically done yesterday and now half of it is outdated. So that's basically what we saw with the action items on Acmeway. But how did the open questions go? And for Northwind Teams, I think the budget is the part that's mostly cosmetic. Actually, should we just agree on what done means? Anyway, I think the risk is that we're overthinking it, if that makes sense",
