      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "But I think the uh, doc is the scary part and the headcount ask is a little behind, so maybe write it down. And then what's the plan for the next steps? Mm, we keep going back and forth on the dependencies, I think...",
