    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Okay, the open questions came up on Friday too, so yeah. But for Acmeway specifically, the priority list is a moving target, which is fine.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:13.070000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:21.403000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "The hiring plan is like mostly fine.",
