      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:09:15.133000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Um, do we know who's looking at the customer advisory board? And nobody really owns the customer advisory board right now, you know what I mean. But I talked to the design team about the customer advisory board and they had some good ideas. Out of curiosity, should we just set up a short sync? Plus we've been saying we'd loop in the other team for a while, right. I think it's less about the offsite agenda and more about the pricing story, you know what I mean. too be fair, like we've been saying we'd do it properly for a while, I don't know. like Look, the last time we touched the planning doc it was half done, um, kind of",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:09:15.473000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:09:56.140000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Um",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:09:56.912000Z",
