    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "I think we lost three or four tries on the priority list last week, you know what I mean. Okay, it's like, the positioning is weirdly controversial and nobody wants to say it.",
