      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:11:42.294000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, it's funny, the communication plan looked pretty solid earlier and now I had more questions than answers.",
