      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:00.115000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Got uh, it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:00.556000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:01.556000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Oh, interesting.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:01.644000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:02.311000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, did anyone look at the comp bands before this call?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:02.432000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:06.098000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Well, the quarterly goals is better than last week, anyway. So the annoying thing about the support load is it's the blocker. Plus I spent a a dozen tickets on the enterprise motion and it's been quiet. So when I looked at the churn analysis for the team plan, there's more going on than I thought. Nobody really owns like the margin question right now, or whatever. I just want to make sure the operating cadence doesn't fall through the cracks.",
