      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:33.156000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But I wouldn't block on the uh, communication plan",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:33.235000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:36.235000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:36.251000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:37.251000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "But like we said we'd write it down and then the timeline happened.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:43.032000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:13:47.365000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, the last time we touched the the margin question it was way overdue, kind of. Which, I'd love to pair on it, but the roadmap tradeoffs is hard too reason about. Well, my worry with the support load is that customers notice before we do. When I looked at the timeline for Acmeway, a couple of things looked off. Yeah, so we said we'd just ship the smaller version and then the comp bands happened. So the design team mentioned the customer advisory board a while back, so it's on people's radar.",
