      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "For sure.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:12.551000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:13.217000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "From my side, the annoying thing about the next steps is it's on the critical path.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:14.262000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:19.595000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Plus is the like next steps still on the critical path, or did that change?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:21.829000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:26.829000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Wait, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:24.570000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:25.170000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, there's a world where we split it into two pieces and the ownership question just goes away",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:27.935000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:34.268000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, interesting.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:33.044000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:33.644000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Sorry",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:34.344000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:34.944000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "it feels like like the positioning and the notes from last time are kind of the same same problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:35.007000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:41.340000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, the short version is like the positioning is hard to reason about. So yeah, part of me wants to run it by support, part of me thinks it's on the critical path.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:41.418000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:52.752000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, so we should probably run it by support before we touch the headcount ask.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:54.743000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:59.743000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But on the team plan, it kind of works.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:15:59.831000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:02.831000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "So the thing I'd push on is the",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:03.948000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:06.615000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "budget",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:06.654000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:07.254000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "But it's like",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:07.306000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:08.306000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "the roadmap tradeoffs is a bit of black box and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:08.904000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:13.904000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Cool, I'll let you all go. Thanks",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:13.945000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:16:16.278000Z"
    }
  ]
